// Docs in legal-leases with NO mapping_id (null/absent). RESULT 2026-08-11: 0.
// NOT a clean tiebreaker for "is LND-8708 live?":
//   count > 0  -> split is live AND publishes unmapped leases with null mapping_id.
//   count == 0 -> AMBIGUOUS: either (a) split not live, OR (b) split live but MINTS a
//                 synthetic non-null mapping_id (the approach we favor) so unmapped-origin
//                 docs still have a mapping_id and this exists-check can't see them.
// Confirm LND-8708 prod state from the land-aws-glue deploy/release, not this query.
// Firm finding regardless: the affected 10 are ABSENT from ES (terms check) and DS9 (query_2).
GET legal-leases/_count
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must_not": [ { "exists": { "field": "mapping_id" } } ]
    }
  }
}
